  "question": {
    "text": "A particle is executing simple harmonic motion with a time period <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>. At time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, it is at its position of equilibrium. The kinetic energy - time graph of the particle will look like:"
  },
